        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/e8a920572bf97e8ab11df02513903342.avif?t=1788352741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras_big/e8a920572bf97e8ab11df02513903342.webp?t=1788352741 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/f90353cfb26582d4e73ee385390b6c22.avif?t=1788352741\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep under Selken City lies The Lab, a crumbling subterranean superstructure barely held together by the rusting metal and crumbling concrete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composed of many 2D hand crafted areas all with unique lore to discover, this world beckons to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal is to make it out of this place by whatever means necessary.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/67bdd787c86607c18630d58f077ec422.avif?t=1788352741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras_big/67bdd787c86607c18630d58f077ec422.webp?t=1788352741 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/3a49ea7a26c7307b69bbe4b3df72c2bc.avif?t=1788352741\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a mix of puzzles in the world, make harrowing jumps, uncover hidden lore, find important items, and escape monsters beyond your comprehension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating this world won't be easy, so keep your wits about, and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you uncover the secrets of this dying world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/589444d89ff820049491f8313cc4c6ca.avif?t=1788352741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras_big/589444d89ff820049491f8313cc4c6ca.webp?t=1788352741 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/8ee5379875724d8190abb5a597d154b5.avif?t=1788352741\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the dark depths you will encounter the long forgotten experiments that were created in The Lab, they'll hunt you, chase you, and make sure you never feel alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Its up to you whether you try to hide, try to run, or try to fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEFORE YOU PLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depths Unseen is for you if you're looking for:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fairly simple gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In depth lore to theorise and speculate on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters to get attached to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fairly diverse soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game with a unique artstyle to sink your teeth into</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depths Unseen is <i>NOT</i> for you if you're looking for:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In depth combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatcha games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>!! PRICE IS TEMPORARY, IT WILL CHANGE NEXT UPDATE !!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/e8a920572bf97e8ab11df02513903342.avif?t=1788352741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras_big/e8a920572bf97e8ab11df02513903342.webp?t=1788352741 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/f90353cfb26582d4e73ee385390b6c22.avif?t=1788352741\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep under Selken City lies The Lab, a crumbling subterranean superstructure barely held together by the rusting metal and crumbling concrete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composed of many 2D hand crafted areas all with unique lore to discover, this world beckons to be seen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal is to make it out of this place by whatever means necessary.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/67bdd787c86607c18630d58f077ec422.avif?t=1788352741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras_big/67bdd787c86607c18630d58f077ec422.webp?t=1788352741 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/3a49ea7a26c7307b69bbe4b3df72c2bc.avif?t=1788352741\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a mix of puzzles in the world, make harrowing jumps, uncover hidden lore, find important items, and escape monsters beyond your comprehension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating this world won't be easy, so keep your wits about, and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you uncover the secrets of this dying world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/589444d89ff820049491f8313cc4c6ca.avif?t=1788352741\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras_big/589444d89ff820049491f8313cc4c6ca.webp?t=1788352741 width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/8ee5379875724d8190abb5a597d154b5.avif?t=1788352741\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the dark depths you will encounter the long forgotten experiments that were created in The Lab, they'll hunt you, chase you, and make sure you never feel alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Its up to you whether you try to hide, try to run, or try to fight.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BEFORE YOU PLAY:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depths Unseen is for you if you're looking for:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fairly simple gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exploration</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Industrial aesthetics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In depth lore to theorise and speculate on</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D platforming</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters to get attached to</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fairly diverse soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game with a unique artstyle to sink your teeth into</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Depths Unseen is <i>NOT</i> for you if you're looking for:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In depth combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiplayer experiences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world adventures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Revolutionary gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gatcha games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >AAA graphics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>IMPORTANT NOTE:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>!! PRICE IS TEMPORARY, IT WILL CHANGE NEXT UPDATE !!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
